xnu 0413: vote haptics hBoost through the PMIC PBS

The HBST page belongs to the charger firmware on this board; writing it
wedged the SPMI command channel. Keep HBST read-only and trigger the PMIC's
own boost sequencer through PMK8350 SDAM 0x9d00 bytes 0x42 and 0xe5.
The play order now disables auto-resonance, clears faults and leaves EN_CTL
set, matching the vendor sequence. The USB channel gets hapb and a read-only
SDAM block so one boot can prove ownership, boost and motion separately.

Ported from akshaynexus/iOSPlus10 146e889,
patches/xnu/0300-negroni-haptic-direct-play.patch (MIT/APSL-2.0).
The GPL-2.0 vendor driver was read as a register specification only.

